# Clickson API

A brief description of what this project does and who it's for


## Installation

Install my-project with yarn

```bash
  yarn i
```

Launch docker 

```bash
 docker compose up -d
 ```
    
## Used By

This project is used by the following project:

- Clickson https://github.com/ABC-TransitionBasCarbone/clickson


